        "code": {"language": "plaintext", "showLineNumbers": false, "showMiniMap": false},
        "content": "### Supported\n\n- Stream selectors, **equality only**:\n  `{service=\"api\", level=\"error\"}`\n- Line filters: `|=` `!=` `|~` `!~`\n- Endpoints: `query`, `query_range`, `labels`,\n  `label/{name}/values`\n\n### Not supported — returns an explicit 400\n\n- Metric queries (`count_over_time`, `rate`,\n  `sum by`) — this is why Explore's log-volume\n  histogram shows an error. Phase 4.6.\n- Pipelines: `| json`, `| logfmt`, `line_format`\n- Regex/negative **label** matchers: `=~` `!=` `!~`\n  (so the variables above are single-select)\n\n### Not implemented — returns 404\n\n- Live tail (`/loki/api/v1/tail`, needs WebSocket)\n- Query size estimate (`/loki/api/v1/index/stats`)\n\nWalkthrough: `docs/runbooks/grafana-logs-demo.md`",
